OL,3,GNEWSAViews split over lower speed limit
OL,4,Aplans
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpinions have been split on proposals
OL,7,Fto introduce a mix of 20mph and 30mph
OL,8,Fspeed limits across five areas in the
OL,9,Fborough of Wokingham.
OL,11,FMore than 1,600 people have given their
OL,12,Fsay on whether limits should be
OL,13,Freduced, with some responding
OL,14,Fpositively while others are not
OL,15,Fconvinced.
OL,17,FLinda Radley said: "It would just
OL,18,Fgenerally slow things more when I
OL,19,Fwouldn't say that the traffic flows
OL,20,Fparticularly fast anyway so I'm not
OL,21,Freally sure why it's been mooted."
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
